# ---- Local AI stack (Gemma) -------------------------------------------------
# Everything under local-stack/ keeps the whole AI setup in one place, but the
# items below are multi-gigabyte binaries or per-machine state. They stay on
# this disk and must never be committed.
local-stack/models/
local-stack/llama.cpp/
local-stack/open-webui/app/
local-stack/open-webui/data/
*.gguf
*.ggml
